{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The original proof performs sound case analysis, but recursively invokes the theorem being defined and finishes the most complicated branch with `grind`. Induction on the first reduction supplies explicit induction hypotheses, while direct constructor terms eliminate the expensive automation and reduce elaboration work.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro a a₁ a₂ h₁ h₂\\n  induction h₁ generalizing a₂ with\\n  | refl a => exact ⟨a₂, h₂, .refl a₂⟩\\n  | @par a a' b b' ha' hb' iha ihb =>\\n    cases h₂\\n    case refl =>\\n      exact ⟨a' ⬝ b', .refl (a' ⬝ b'), .par ha' hb'⟩\\n    case par a'' b'' ha'' hb'' =>\\n      let ⟨a₃, ha⟩ := iha ha''\\n      let ⟨b₃, hb⟩ := ihb hb''\\n      exact ⟨a₃ ⬝ b₃, .par ha.1 hb.1, .par ha.2 hb.2⟩\\n    case red_I =>\\n      rw [I_irreducible a' ha']\\n      exact ⟨b', .red_I b', hb'⟩\\n    case red_K =>\\n      let ⟨a₂', ha₂'⟩ := Ka_irreducible a₂ a' ha'\\n      rw [ha₂'.2]\\n      exact ⟨a₂', .red_K a₂' b', ha₂'.1⟩\\n    case red_S a c =>\\n      let ⟨a'', c', h⟩ := Sab_irreducible a c a' ha'\\n      rw [h.2.2]\\n      exact ⟨a'' ⬝ b' ⬝ (c' ⬝ b'), .red_S a'' c' b',\\n        .par (.par h.1 hb') (.par h.2.1 hb')⟩\\n  | red_I a =>\\n    cases h₂\\n    case refl => exact ⟨a, .refl a, .red_I a⟩\\n    case par c a' hc ha =>\\n      rw [I_irreducible c hc]\\n      exact ⟨a', ha, .red_I a'⟩\\n    case red_I => exact ⟨a, .refl a, .refl a⟩\\n  | red_K a b =>\\n    cases h₂\\n    case refl => exact ⟨a, .refl a, .red_K a b⟩\\n    case par a' b' ha hb =>\\n      let ⟨a'', h⟩ := Ka_irreducible a a' ha\\n      rw [h.2]\\n      exact ⟨a'', h.1, .red_K a'' b'⟩\\n    case red_K => exact ⟨a, .refl a, .refl a⟩\\n  | red_S a b c =>\\n    cases h₂\\n    case refl =>\\n      exact ⟨a ⬝ c ⬝ (b ⬝ c), .refl _, .red_S ..⟩\\n    case par d c' hd hc =>\\n      let ⟨a', b', h⟩ := Sab_irreducible a b d hd\\n      rw [h.2.2]\\n      exact ⟨a' ⬝ c' ⬝ (b' ⬝ c'),\\n        .par (.par h.1 hc) (.par h.2.1 hc), .red_S ..⟩\\n    case red_S =>\\n      exact ⟨a ⬝ c ⬝ (b ⬝ c), .refl _, .refl _⟩\"}"}}
